    "summary": "A wide pillowcase, made of hand spun and handwoven cotton.  Made from one long, rectangular piece of cream-coloured cotton fabric folded in half weft-ways.  The fabric consists of alternating red and black stripes (woven as bands) each separated by self colour bands.  The closed end has thicker red and black stripes (extended tabby).  The open end has been turned and stitched.  A part of this edge is damaged.  The sides (selvedges) are decorated with red and black embroidery.",
